{"sections":[{"slug":"综合数学","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"综合数学"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">综合数学</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">观念</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"综合数学"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"观念"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">分析与综合之辨</span></h3>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">分析</span></strong> (analysis) <span lang=\"zh\">与</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">综合</span></strong> (synthesis) <span lang=\"zh\">是数学的两种思维模式</span>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh\">分析</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">是将所研究的对象拆解为更简单的东西</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">直至还原为最基本的对象</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">通常是集合</span>);</li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh\">综合</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">是规定所研究的对象应当具有的性质</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">行为或关系</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">而不关心其底层的构造</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">以平面几何为例</span>,</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">经典的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">分析</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">方法是</span> Descartes <span lang=\"zh\">建立的解析几何</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">使用平面直角坐标系将所有几何对象还原为点的集合</span>;</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">经典的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">综合</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">方法是</span> Euclid (<span lang=\"zh\">或更严格的</span> Hilbert) <span lang=\"zh\">建立的公理几何</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">规定点</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">直线等对象的性质</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">而不关心其具体构造</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">综合数学</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">通常</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">一种综合数学的理论可视为对一个具有较丰富性质的范畴</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">如</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/意象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">意象</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">以</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/意象的内语言","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">内语言</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的方式强加的要求</span>; <span lang=\"zh\">正如一个代数方程是对一个环强加的要求</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">见</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/synthetic","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">综合数学是抽象代数的范畴化</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}}]}